# Enterprise Edition

Overlay under `enterprise/` extends OSS via `prepend_mod_with` / `include_mod_with`. Fork features (non-SaaS) → `custom/` per `fork-workflow.mdc`.

Before editing: `rg -n "FooService|ControllerName|ModelName" app enterprise`

## Checklist

- Enterprise-only behavior → module via `prepend_mod_with`, not direct OSS edits
- Enterprise-exclusive features → code under `enterprise/`
- New endpoints/services/models → check Enterprise override or extension point
- No plan-specific behavior hardcoded in OSS — use config or feature flags
- Mirror renames/moves in `enterprise/`; specs in `spec/enterprise/`

Reference: https://chatwoot.help/hc/handbook/articles/developing-enterprise-edition-features-38
